### Actualizar disponibilidad de un profesional
PUT http://localhost:3000/professionals/1/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "availableDays": ["Monday", "Tuesday", "Wednesday"],
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "17:00"
}

### Agregar una excepción a la disponibilidad del profesional
POST http://localhost:3000/professionals/1/exceptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2025-07-20",
  "reason": "Vacaciones"
}

### Obtener disponibilidad de un profesional
GET http://localhost:3000/professionals/1/availability

### Obtener citas (appointments) del profesional
GET http://localhost:3000/professionals/1/appointments
